SUMMARY:Bowl at the Beach
DESCRIPTION:Bowl at the Beach will bring together 150 young professionals from Toronto’s east end and beyond for an evening of lawn bowling\, friendly competition\, prizes\, refreshments\, and entertainment. All proceeds will support the Michael Garron Hospital. Those interested must form a full team of four\, fundraise a minimum of $1\,000 per team and register to participate.
