SUMMARY:Councillor Fletcher's East York Compost Day
DESCRIPTION:Get your shovels ready! Councillor Fletcher has arranged for free compost to be dropped at the East York Civic Centre on Tuesday\, June 23rd at 8 a.m. during the weekly East York Farmers’ Market. \nGet your compost\, then pick up some fresh\, local food from the great vendors of the East York Farmers’ Market\, open from 8 a.m. to 2 p.m. \nCompost will be dropped off in the northwest area of the East York Civic Centre near the intersection of Memorial Park and Durant. \n*Please bring your own shovels and containers as compost will not be bagged.* \n*Compost will be available on a first-come\, first-served basis and delivered rain or shine.*
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/councillor-fletchers-east-york-compost-day/
LOCATION:East York Civic Centre\, 850 Coxwell Ave.\, Toronto
ORGANIZER;CN="City Councillor Paula Fletcher":MAILTO:councillor_fletcher@toronto.ca
END:VEVENT
